Usage: agent-deck fleet <command> [options]

Detect and recover from a fleet-wide session death (every managed
pane gone at once: a killed tmux server, a host reboot, or an auth
cascade that made the agents exit).

Commands:
  status     Report which sessions are down (read-only, never writes)
  recover    Restart the down sessions sequentially, verifying each boot

Examples:
  agent-deck fleet status
  agent-deck fleet recover                 # plan only (dry run)
  agent-deck fleet recover --yes           # actually recover
  agent-deck fleet recover --yes --spacing 8s --limit 10
  agent-deck fleet recover --yes --group agent-deck
